          <p>{item.body}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    ))}
  </div>

  <h3>The three proofs</h3>

  <div class="gates-block">
    <div class="gates-row">
      <div class="gate">
        <span class="gate__num">Proof 1</span>
        <span class="gate__name">Show it</span>
        <p>Make a one-page repayment sheet with the loan amount, rate, moratorium interest, EMI and the starting pay you need. Next to it, keep one small piece of real work from your subject that a hiring manager could open and judge.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="gate">
        <span class="gate__num">Proof 2</span>
        <span class="gate__name">Say it</span>
        <p>Explain to your parents in 30 seconds to 2 minutes, without notes, what is pledged, who must repay and what the EMI is.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="gate">
        <span class="gate__num">Proof 3</span>
        <span class="gate__name">Get it checked</span>
        <p>Show the sheet to a bank officer, a recent graduate of the same course and someone who has repaid an education loan. Ask what they would check twice, and whether the plan looks useful to them.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

